  "description": "Re-experience the thrill of high-speed inter-city rail as you push the throttle through bustling German Metropolis, the rolling open countryside awaits in the exquisite Train Sim World®: Schnellfahrstrecke Köln - Aachen, now fully remastered in a free update! Operate mixed-traffic services and take in the new volumetric skies, enhanced foliage and more, brought to you by FolezzWorld.\n\nThe Köln - Aachen high speed railway is part of the Trans-European transport network with line speeds up to 250 km/h. The route is steeped in history, from its heavily debated original concept to the landmarks and bridges making up the surrounding landscape. Explore the wonderful Burtscheid Viaduct, historic triangle truss Dreigurtbrücke, and the Köln skyline including the beautiful cathedral."
